-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=venom%20powerful%20enough%20to%20slay%20most%20living%20things","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Hour of Glory","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-06-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=venom%20powerful%20enough%20to%20slay%20most%20living%20things","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Hour of Glory\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Jun 2017."}},{"id":"hour-glory-2017-06-21-e8","era":null,"summary":"The scorpion god grapples Rhonas from behind and pierces his skull with its tail sting.","participants":["scorpion-god","rhonas"],"location":"gate-to-the-afterlife","importance":"major","page":"stories/hour-glory-2017-06-21","order":612,"story_date":"2017-06-21","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":48,"quote":"the scorpion tail, arched over the god, piercing his own skull.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=the%20scorpion%20tail%2C%20arched,piercing%20his%20own%20skull.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Hour of Glory","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-06-21","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=the%20scorpion%20tail%2C%20arched,piercing%20his%20own%20skull.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Hour of Glory\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 21 Jun 2017."}},{"id":"hour-glory-2017-06-21-e9","era":null,"summary":"As the poison unbinds Bolas's magic, Rhonas remembers the true history of the dragon, the corrupted gods, and the original eight.","participants":["rhonas","nicol-bolas"],"location":"gate-to-the-after